## 🧠 2. Canonical Vertex AI Multimodal Endpoints & Models

### A. Agentic Chat, Vision & Tool Calling (`locations/global`)
- **Models**:
  - `gemini-3-flash-preview` (Recommended default for low-latency multimodal chat & tool loops)
  - `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` (Complex reasoning & storyboard planning)
  - `gemini-2.5-flash` (Fast multimodal & audio transcription)
- **Endpoint**:
  `https://aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1beta1/projects/{PROJECT_ID}/locations/global/publishers/google/models/{MODEL}:generateContent`
- **Critical Pitfall — `thoughtSignature` Preservation on Gemini 3**:
  - When `gemini-3-flash-preview` or `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` emits a `functionCall` part, the response part includes a `thoughtSignature` field (`part.thoughtSignature`).
  - When sending the model's `functionCall` turn back in the next request's `contents` history alongside your `functionResponse`, you **MUST** include `thoughtSignature: part.thoughtSignature` on the `functionCall` part. Omitting it triggers HTTP 400: `Function call is missing a thought_signature in functionCall parts`.

### B. Image, Sticker, Overlay & Wallpaper Generation (`us-central1` / `global`)
- **Model**: `gemini-2.5-flash-image` (Nano Banana)
- **Endpoint**:
  `https://aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1beta1/projects/{PROJECT_ID}/locations/us-central1/publishers/google/models/gemini-2.5-flash-image:generateContent`
- **Payload**:
  ```json
  {
    "contents": [{ "role": "user", "parts": [{ "text": "<prompt>" }] }],
    "generationConfig": { "responseModalities": ["TEXT", "IMAGE"] }
  }
  ```
- Extract `inlineData.data` (base64 PNG/JPEG) from `candidates[0].content.parts`. Supports passing reference images in `parts` for image-to-image style transfer.

### C. Video Generation & Webcam/Clip Restyling (`us-central1`)
- **Models**:
  - `veo-3.1-fast-generate-001` (Fast video generation & restyling)
  - `veo-3.1-generate-001` (High-definition 720p/1080p video with audio)
- **Start Job Endpoint**:
  `https://us-central1-aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1beta1/projects/{PROJECT_ID}/locations/us-central1/publishers/google/models/{MODEL}:predictLongRunning`
- **Payload**:
  ```json
  {
    "instances": [{
      "prompt": "<prompt>",
      "image": { "bytesBase64Encoded": "<optional_ref_frame_b64>", "mimeType": "image/jpeg" }
    }],
    "parameters": {
      "aspectRatio": "16:9",
      "sampleCount": 1,
      "durationSeconds": 4,
      "personGeneration": "allow_all"
    }
  }
  ```
- **Poll Operation Endpoint**:
  POST `{ "operationName": "<op_name>" }` to:
  `https://us-central1-aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1beta1/projects/{PROJECT_ID}/locations/us-central1/publishers/google/models/{MODEL}:fetchPredictOperation`
  until `done: true`, then decode `response.videos[0].bytesBase64Encoded`.

### D. Voiceover / Text-to-Speech Synthesis (`global` + Cloud TTS Fallback)
- **Primary Models**: `gemini-2.5-flash-tts`, `gemini-2.5-pro-tts` (`locations/global`)
- **Payload**:
  ```json
  {
    "contents": [{ "role": "user", "parts": [{ "text": "<script>" }] }],
    "generationConfig": {
      "responseModalities": ["AUDIO"],
      "speechConfig": {
        "voiceConfig": { "prebuiltVoiceConfig": { "voiceName": "Kore" } }
      }
    }
  }
  ```
  *(Available voices: `Kore`, `Puck`, `Aoede`, `Charon`, `Fenrir`, `Zephyr`)*.
- **Critical Pitfall — Raw PCM (`audio/L16`) to WAV Framing**:
  - `gemini-2.5-flash-tts` returns raw 16-bit signed little-endian mono PCM at `24000 Hz` (`mimeType: "audio/L16;codec=pcm;rate=24000"`).
  - Before writing `.wav` to disk or loading into FFmpeg/HTMLAudioElement, prepend a 44-byte RIFF/WAVE header (`sampleRate=24000`, `numChannels=1`, `bitsPerSample=16`) if `buf.subarray(0, 4).toString("ascii") !== "RIFF"`.
- **Fallback Endpoint**:
  `https://texttospeech.googleapis.com/v1/text:synthesize` with `audioConfig: { audioEncoding: "MP3" }` and `x-goog-user-project: <PROJECT_ID>`.

### E. Instrumental Background Music Generation (`us-central1`)
- **Model**: `lyria-002`
- **Endpoint**:
  `https://us-central1-aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1/projects/{PROJECT_ID}/locations/us-central1/publishers/google/models/lyria-002:predict`
- **Payload**: `{ "instances": [{ "prompt": "<music description>" }], "parameters": { "sampleCount": 1 } }`
- Returns base64 WAV audio in `predictions[0].audioContent`.

### F. Pydantic-AI GoogleProvider & Python SSL Guard
- In modern `pydantic-ai`, connect to Vertex AI using:
  ```python
  from pydantic_ai.models.google import GoogleModel
  from pydantic_ai.providers.google import GoogleProvider

  # Ensure valid SSL CA bundle on macOS / isolated venvs
  if not os.environ.get("SSL_CERT_FILE") or not Path(os.environ["SSL_CERT_FILE"]).exists():
      os.environ["SSL_CERT_FILE"] = certifi.where()

  provider = GoogleProvider(
      vertexai=True,
      project=project_id,
      location="global",  # 'global' for Gemini 3; 'us-central1' for older endpoints
  )
  model = GoogleModel("gemini-3.1-pro-preview", provider=provider)
  ```
- **Pitfall — Stale `SSL_CERT_FILE`**: If a virtualenv sets `SSL_CERT_FILE` pointing to a non-existent or relocated certifi file, Vertex AI API calls fail immediately with TLS errors. Always verify `Path(os.environ["SSL_CERT_FILE"]).exists()` and fall back to `certifi.where()`.

